// Title: Potential APT FIN7 Reconnaissance/POWERTRASH Related Activity
// Sigma ID: 911389c7-5ae3-43ea-bab3-a947ebdeb85e
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-05-04 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, G0046
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects specific command line execution used by FIN7 as reported by WithSecureLabs for
//   reconnaissance and POWERTRASH execution
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://labs.withsecure.com/publications/fin7-target-veeam-servers
//   - https://labs.withsecure.com/publications/fin7-target-veeam-servers/jcr:content/root/responsivegrid/responsivegrid/responsivegrid/image_253944286.img.png/1682500394900.png
//   - https://github.com/WithSecureLabs/iocs/blob/344203de742bb7e68bd56618f66d34be95a9f9fc/FIN7VEEAM/iocs.csv
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/FIN7/proc_creation_win_apt_fin7_powertrash_lateral_movement.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains "-noni -nop -exe bypass -f \\\\" and ProcessCommandLine contains "ADMIN$") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "-ex bypass -noprof -nolog -nonint -f" and ProcessCommandLine contains "C:\\Windows\\Temp\\")
